	(descr "DDK BB35K-RA18-3A receptacle: Vincent's hand-made land (iphone-x-shim 82bdf4d, D-9) with every pad 0.2 mm longer at its outer end, away from the body, for hand soldering (truedepth-shim D-23, Vincent: 'hand solder so make the pads longer slightly...'): signal pads 0.18 x 0.545 at y +-0.98 (his 0.18 x 0.345 at +-0.88); tab side pads 0.6 x 0.525 at y +-0.985 (his 0.6 x 0.325 at +-0.885); tab end pads 0.47 x 1.2 at x +-2.975 (his 0.27 x 1.2 at +-2.875). Pitch, pad width, inner ends and pad numbers as he drew them; courtyard, silk end lines and pin-1 tick moved out 0.2 mm with the pads; F.Fab is the body, unchanged. Base: Fujikura FB35K catalogue p4")
